# pinned.list - the dock's pinned applications, one .desktop id (the filename
# without ".desktop") per line, in dock order, maximum 8.
#
# This file is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for the pinned area of the dock.
# xxri-dock-pin regenerates /usr/local/tce.icons from it (plus dot.wbar's own
# header triple) every time it changes, and wbar_setup.sh reads it fresh at
# every boot.  Do not hand-edit while the desktop is running - use
# `xxri-dock-pin pin|unpin <id>` so the live dock and this file never drift
# apart.
#
# This is exactly today's 8-icon dock (Phase 10.2), captured here as the
# permanent default: if this file is ever missing, the desktop should be
# reseeded with these entries, not a shorter or reordered list.
xxri-store
xxri-settings
xxri-file
aterm
xxri-browser
xxri-media
xxri-editor
xxri-power
